            "value": "<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-QnuFdbLepon6paxnl0xlmEapglb\">Overall, except for Italy, which is expected to see a steady decline in its population, all other countries are forecast to experience growth during the period shown. Among the four nations, Indonesia had the highest population in 2003 and is projected to maintain this position through to 2050.</div>\n</div>",
